{"Title":"An Act modify the safe drivers insurance plan relative to minor violation","BillNumber":"H1126","DocketNumber":"HD1586","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"DMR1","Name":"David M. Rogers","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DMR1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:14:05.797"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"DMR1","Name":"David M. Rogers","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DMR1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:14:05.7966667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H1126/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Rogers of Cambridge, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 1126) of David M. Rogers relative to the modification of the safe drivers insurance plan relative to minor violations.  Financial Services.","DocumentText":"\tSection 113B of Chapter 175 shall be amended by striking the second sentence of the thirteenth paragraph, and by substituting therefor the following:\r\n\tThe adjustment shall apply to every driver with no surchargeable incidents, or with one surchargeable incident for which 2 or fewer unsafe driver points have been assigned, within the 5 years immediately preceding the applicable rate year.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J11","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J11"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}